# Sequenced effects through the live overlay: the sidecar's cursor mask is the subject of
# both sigiled statements — one emission, one frozen environment — and the bare world moves
# only where the effects say. knockback and flash are registered verbs; `;` sequences them.
n 6
col pos num 0 10 20 30 40 50
col tint sym None None None None None None
col shielded bool 1 1 1 0 1 0
col gold num 5 10 15 20 25 30
col blessed bool 0 1 0 0 0 0
fn knockback pos {s 𝕊 c‿k: c+k×s}
fn flash tint {s 𝕊 c‿v: s‿((+´s)⥊v) AnoScat c}
ja 位置 pos
ja 色合 tint
ja 防護 shielded
ja 金 gold
ja 祝福 blessed
